            "text": "```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\n\n\ndef business_days(date1: str, date2: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    2つの日付の間にある営業日（月〜金）の数を返す。\n    2つの日付自身は含まない。\n    日付の順序が逆でも、間の日数を正の値で返す。\n    \"\"\"\n    d1 = datetime.strptime(date1, \"%Y-%m-%d\").date()\n    d2 = datetime.strptime(date2, \"%Y-%m-%d\").date()\n\n    # 日付の順序をそろえる\n    if d1 > d2:\n        d1, d2 = d2, d1\n\n    count = 0\n    current = d1 + timedelta(days=1)\n\n    while current < d2:\n        # Monday=0, ..., Friday=4\n        if current.weekday() < 5:\n            count += 1\n        current += timedelta(days=1)\n\n    return count\n```\n\n使用例：\n\n```python\nprint(business_days(\"2024-01-01\", \"2024-01-08\"))\n# 4\n```\n\n`2024-01-02`〜`2024-01-05`の4日間だけが数えられます。"
